{"seq":34,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1572"},"reason":"The Tor Project explains the name as 'the onion routing' (Wikipedia: 'then called The Onion Routing project, later given the acronym Tor'); body sentence and table now give The Onion Routing, with The Onion Router as the common alternative; notes added.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://2019.www.torproject.org/docs/faq.html.en"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tor_(network)"}],"changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",74],["-","Router,"],["+","Routing"],["=",1],["+","(often expanded as The Onion Router), "],["=",836],["-","Router"],["+","Routing"],["=",110]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",74],["-","Router,"],["+","Routing"],["=",1],["+","(oft auch als The Onion Router aufgelöst), "],["=",808],["-","Router"],["+","Routing"],["=",104]]},{"field":"bodyRu","diff":[["=",70],["+","Routing («луковая маршрутизация»; часто расшифровывают и как The Onion "],["=",2],["-","(«луковый"],["+","–"],["=",1],["+","«луковый "],["=",772],["-","Router"],["+","Routing"],["=",108]]},{"field":"notesEn","old":"","new":"The Tor Project derives the name from „the onion routing“ (its NRL predecessor project); the common expansion „The Onion Router“ – used even in the title of the 2004 Tor design paper – is also accepted."},{"field":"notesDe","diff":[["+","Das Tor Project leitet den Namen von „the onion routing“ ab (dem Vorgängerprojekt des Naval Research Lab); die verbreitete Auflösung „The Onion Router“ – sie steht sogar im Titel des Tor-Grundlagenpapiers von 2004 – wird ebenfalls anerkannt."]]},{"field":"notesRu","old":"","new":"Tor Project выводит название из «the onion routing» (так назывался исходный проект Лаборатории ВМС США); распространённая расшифровка «The Onion Router» – она стоит даже в заголовке статьи 2004 года с описанием Tor – тоже засчитывается."}],"hash":"b7f5bb2b9d92","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"8dc710b122b8ff20289501cbf5c91867261c88f661ab35c12bbbf7fb12a9a78e"},
{"seq":35,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"corrected","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f07856"},"reason":"Answer 'The Onion Router' → 'The Onion Routing' per the Tor Project's own explanation; 'The Onion Router' (used in the 2004 design paper's title) stays accepted via the notes. Span re-placed.","by":"provenance-research","sources":[{"url":"https://2019.www.torproject.org/docs/faq.html.en"},{"url":"https://support.torproject.org/about/why-is-it-called-tor/"},{"url":"https://www.usenix.org/legacy/publications/library/proceedings/sec04/tech/dingledine.html"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","old":"The Onion Router","new":"The Onion Routing"},{"field":"answerDe","old":"The Onion Router","new":"The Onion Routing"},{"field":"answerRu","old":"The Onion Router","new":"The Onion Routing"},{"field":"spans","old":{"en":[213,16],"de":[230,16],"ru":[243,16]},"new":{"en":[213,17],"de":[230,17],"ru":[243,17]}}],"hash":"2b18517bbcb7","actor":{"kind":"agent","name":"provenance-research"},"run":"provenance-research-2026-10-23","chain":"e1d2971fb8561eb96e7c984ad9b0873095a975fbec05ac05610b48248477de1b"},
